\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Five uses of simulation in statistical practice. The simulation loop occupies the earliest and narrowest of these roles. It complements rather than replaces the others; a study designed with the loop would naturally be analysed with a workflow of the kind described by \citet  {wolkovichFourstepSimulationbasedWorkflow2026} or \citet  {gelmanBayesianWorkflow2020}.\relax }}{8}{table.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
